{# WP-B2 TEST, NOT SHIPPED AS A FEATURE. Rendered by SNRom_Bridge.ProbeConversations
   through SkyrimNetApi.RenderTemplate, with no model call. Answers three questions
   before conversation enrollment is built on it:
     1. Does RenderTemplate work from a quest script, with native decorators?
     2. What does a recent event carry - names only, or something that identifies
        the speaker (a UUID, a FormID)?
     3. Does a variable passed in (the watermark the real scan will need) arrive?
   The raw events are dumped whole so their fields can be read. #}
probe.since = {{ default(probe.since, "missing") }}
{% set events = get_recent_events(25) %}
event count = {{ length(events) }}
{% for ev in events %}
EV {{ loop.index }}: {{ ev }}
{% endfor %}
